# Audio asset directory
#
# The site's sound effects (page-turn, paper-rustle, etc) are synthesized
# in lib/audio.ts using the Web Audio API — no files required.
#
# To swap in a real recording, drop a file here (e.g. paper-rustle.mp3) and
# update lib/audio.ts to fetch + decode it instead of calling generateSound().
# Specifically:
#   - polaroid hover triggers audioManager.playThrottled("paper-rustle"),
#     which currently plays the synthesized buffer.
